  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "31d1247e-d91c-49d4-9906-84ac8e8841f9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Now the total spent seems reasonable for both groups. We have 6161 B2C customers with mean spent of 978€ and max spent of 3171€ and 2947 B2B customers with mean spent of 13368€ and max spent of 257773€. Next we can do RFM-analysis for both groups separetly. "
   ]
  },
  {
