   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a1544348-9810-47cc-9b95-686d6ebdf355",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We cant divide transactions the same way we did with R_scores, because they are Centered between 1 and 4 and therefore we cant make clear groups with qcut. Lets define the groups by hand."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "1b4d93b5-3d26-414e-813a-db848ada74c2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "B2C:\n",
      "F_score\n",
      "2    2295\n",
      "4    1975\n",
      "3    1389\n",
      "1     325\n",
      "5     177\n",
      "Name: count, dtype: int64\n",
      "B2B:\n",
      "F_score\n",
      "2    1155\n",
      "4    1007\n",
      "3     716\n",
      "1     140\n",
      "5     122\n",
      "Name: count, dtype: int64\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#Conditions for groups\n",
    "B2C_conditions=[\n",
    "    (df_B2C[\"TotalTransactions\"]>=7),\n",
    "    (df_B2C[\"TotalTransactions\"]>=4) & (df_B2C[\"TotalTransactions\"]<=6),\n",
    "    (df_B2C[\"TotalTransactions\"]==3),\n",
    "    (df_B2C[\"TotalTransactions\"]>=1) & (df_B2C[\"TotalTransactions\"]<=2),\n",
    "    (df_B2C[\"TotalTransactions\"]==0)\n",
    "]\n",
    "B2B_conditions=[\n",
    "    (df_B2B[\"TotalTransactions\"]>=7),\n",
    "    (df_B2B[\"TotalTransactions\"]>=4) & (df_B2B[\"TotalTransactions\"]<=6),\n",
    "    (df_B2B[\"TotalTransactions\"]==3),\n",
    "    (df_B2B[\"TotalTransactions\"]>=1) & (df_B2B[\"TotalTransactions\"]<=2),\n",
    "    (df_B2B[\"TotalTransactions\"]==0)\n",
    "]\n",
    "scores=[5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\n",
    "\n",
    "#Lets add F_score column\n",
    "df_B2C[\"F_score\"]=np.select(B2C_conditions, scores, default=0)\n",
    "print(\"B2C:\")\n",
    "print(df_B2C[\"F_score\"].value_counts())\n",
    "\n",
    "df_B2B[\"F_score\"]=np.select(B2B_conditions, scores, default=0)\n",
    "print(\"B2B:\")\n",
    "print(df_B2B[\"F_score\"].value_counts())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a9bc0eed-42bc-4d28-a648-c7e8d06fe753",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "As M_score we can use ABC classes we did earlier. Next we can give rank to every customer based on their RFM score."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
